extraction_notes: |
  - Rifts Conversion Book One printed 80-82 (file p081-p083). No Palladium Fantasy row exists for the Kankoran; the id carries the `rifts-` prefix batch 1 used, because a Palladium Fantasy conversion could later claim the plain id.
