# Kankoran

## Lore

The Kankoran are humanoid foxes - four to five and a half feet of luscious red fur with a white-tipped tail - who live simple, Spartan lives as hunters and woodsmen in harmony with nature. Gentle and loving among their own kind, their society is still harsh: every youth passes a rite of passage, often six months to a year alone off the land, and takes a name from it (Leftside-Wound, Mountain Shadow, Knife Handle). They call scars "stripes" and respect anyone with a good collection. Legend says the Elves created them, so they honor Elves and get along with the gentler Faerie Folk and elemental spirits. Outsiders who undergo a Kankoran rite are accepted completely, and Kankoran often adopt stray children of any race.

They are not dimensional travelers, so any Kankoran on Rifts Earth is there by accident or for a compelling reason, and more than half a dozen in one place is unlikely. Courageous and kind, a Kankoran will come to the aid of anyone in need.

**Alignment:** Any, but tend toward good and Unprincipled.

**Size:** Four to five feet plus 1D6 inches (about 1.2 to 1.6 m). **Weight:** 80 to 140 pounds (36 to 63 kg).

**Average Life Span:** 45+ years.

**Habitat:** Theoretically anywhere, but prefers forests; on the Palladium World most live in the northern forests and mountains.

## GM Notes

Kankoran should find Native Americans and Wild Psi-Stalkers kindred spirits, and get along with Druids, Cyber-Knights, Sasquatch, the Lyn-Srial, mutant animals, Faerie Folk and forest peoples - more comfortable among animal-looking D-Bees than humans. Warriors inside robots, power armor and armored vehicles strike them as cowards; they take an instant dislike to cruel savages like the Simvan and Brodkil, and see Calgary''s Kingdom of Monsters, vampires, the Federation of Magic, the Splugorth and the Gargoyle and Brodkil Empires as evil. They have no formal enemies but hate tormentors, slavers and destroyers. The Wolfen employ them as scouts. On Palladium they carry obsidian daggers and spears; on Rifts Earth they use Vibro-Blades, energy and Techno-Wizard weapons and light body armor.
